<body>
    <h1>PRD IIS Integrations</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
 <div class=3D"columnLayout two-right-sidebar" data-layout=3D"two-right-sid=
ebar">
  <div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
   <div class=3D"innerCell">
    <h1 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-FeaturePositioning">Feature Positioning</h=
1>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-FeatureOverview">Feature Overview</h2>
    <p>The goal of re-visiting the IIS integrations into CX is to ensure th=
at there is a single place to see and manage user configurations for any CX=
 module.</p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-ProblemStatement"><span>Problem Statement<=
/span></h2>
    <p>...</p>
    <p><strong style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Key Frictions &amp; Opportu=
nities</strong></p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 94.1696%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 7.76315%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 26.6066%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 31.8652%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 33.7651%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Feature Registration =E2=86=92</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Firm &amp; User Assignment =E2=86=92</th=
>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">User Access, Navigation &amp; Sessions</=
th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#f4f5f7">Task</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a5363617-c3bb-4d46-882e-60dd997e486f">Register n=
ew features on platform to make the feature available for platform services=
 to consume</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4f745cd9-e67d-4cac-89b8-08f45f280685">Assign new=
 features to all or specific firms</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"03f8e798-5004-4231-b32b-1ee3d990ed4c">Assign new=
 features to all or specific user groups</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"91a57828-a586-49a9-80ae-40c0699e421a">User acces=
ses IIS features for their operational activities</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"highlight-#f4f5f7 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#f4f5f7">Current Interactions</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"89abb6b2-c1e9-41c1-b7f2-19b900fd19a1">N/A.&nbsp;=
 Features are not represented as its own concept on the platform today</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Two paths:</p>
         <ol>
          <li data-uuid=3D"775be299-806e-4c2f-8bee-ee654535d841">New module=
 resource(s) are provided to the CX platform team to add to firm and user p=
ackages for onward firm&nbsp;/ user configuration (Data Export, Paper Uploa=
d)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"ce01c2fd-7781-4aa2-8876-e0acaa8a38b0">New module=
s are added under an existing "Tools" menu and firm / user are assigned "To=
ols"</li>
         </ol></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5042a561-3a82-459f-9954-cc2af05cb224">User is gr=
anted a CX profile containing access to specific IIS modules&nbsp;</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"de5d0870-f482-4641-b7b7-4e38e04bfef7">User logs =
in, is authenticated &amp; authorized by CX, then proceeds into IIS module =
directly</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"675eca82-07b9-4dcc-9c76-08863d8d36dd">IIS retain=
s a record of which user accesses which tool to enable re-entry (technicall=
y a centralized Tier 1 SSO implementation)</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"highlight-#ffebe6 confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#ffebe6">Frictions</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"2f275ed9-06dd-4b5a-84e1-3a46b5e3e452">No visibil=
ity into feature inventory</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"89190b54-88f6-4d8d-a116-39db8656dcf4">Inconsiste=
nt implementation causes feature onboarding confusion and churn with each f=
eature</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"97f1de80-b985-4aec-9925-77077ebda7ec">Second pat=
h prevents modules within Tools (e.g. Estates, Transfers) to be assignable =
to firm and users specifically, requiring off-platform tracking / reporting=
</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"19f027ca-1ae1-4227-98b0-da19eae8575d">In the cas=
e of "Tools", lacks granularity of access control that might be required fo=
r core functions (e.g. Estates, Transfers)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"49aba268-b067-47ce-a69e-7616ae57148d">In the cas=
e of "Tools", lacks the unique entry points required to harmonize the CX na=
vigation and creates a secondary navigation that requires separate orientat=
ion</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTh" data-highlight-colour=
=3D"#e3fcef">Opportunities</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"81c68c2b-ae37-4e22-b0a0-256d4347af3f">With the i=
ntroduction of a Feature configuration module in CX, features can now be on=
boarded and used by downstream services like firm &amp; user configuration,=
 system health events, feature notifications, user attestations, user assig=
nment audit trail</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b972c2c2-fdf6-4704-8f7f-0a1b85f5e937">IIS featur=
es can now be represented in the platform to benefit from the above</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"93edf33f-baa5-4b9d-bf0b-d7994f3c3ed2">Formally o=
nboard all IIS module resources under path 1 as part of our Tier 1 integrat=
ion standard</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"1d5394ac-427c-485b-8b72-d05dc22ae399">Register I=
IS modules are independent module resources for use in CX-side packaging</l=
i>
          <li data-uuid=3D"b9b5d159-5ad9-413f-9a03-ba921cb80999">Update IIS=
 module entry point for all modules to be single page / no nav.</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8f9b6258-c655-4818-ae7a-940733459684">Introduce =
session time-outs</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">&nbsp;</span>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"cell aside" data-type=3D"aside">
