icable to all firms</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9856e625-39c3-4585-8ee9-c05877d2630b">Med - navi=
gation frictions do not prevent users in performing their jobs</li>
         </ul></td>
