    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-TargetAudience">Target Audience</h2>
    <h3 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-UserPersonas">User Personas</h3>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 52.7748%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 12.6145%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 38.7541%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 48.6314%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Persona</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Goals</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Needs</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Platform Integrator</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"974ff3ec-1350-4769-8c1e-13322d6d32d6">Represent =
new features on platform with accuracy and agility</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"13e54700-a23d-4849-8c48-ff3febaed4dc">Clear, sim=
ple execution patterns and sufficient tooling to register new features</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Feature Activations</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f34f1da9-eddd-410a-86b3-3daa285491f2">Ability to=
 get new features into the hands of the right firms and users</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"82485410-9bd5-4810-8157-50bcda4dd394">Sufficient=
 firm and user configuration controls to assign feature with precision</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"bc710658-15c2-4ebe-b312-9eb641f78a85">Easy to fo=
llow procedures to avoid mistakes in over-provisioning&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Digital Support</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d128e23f-c525-4703-b1cd-f90dc06a4ff3">Ability to=
 troubleshoot feature access issues across platform(s)</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"d840bb2d-07f6-4b33-9e2d-33446399f851">Visibility=
 into user configuration and assignment history for all platform features&n=
bsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Compass User</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"c106f49f-fa13-44a6-8016-d8b2cf16d2fb">Get access=
 to features for their job functions&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"9e7b7f26-bbeb-42c3-95c9-585f84714a9e">Low barrie=
r to entry &amp; ease of orientation to the features they need to be operat=
ionally efficient&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <h3 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-FeatureObjectives&amp;Metrics"><span style=
=3D"font-size: 20.0px;font-weight: normal;letter-spacing: -0.008em;">Featur=
e Objectives &amp; Metrics</span></h3>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 47.3525%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 5.73899%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 45.0399%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 49.2211%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Rank</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Feature Goal</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">KPI</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Bridge operational gaps caused by discon=
nected feature management&nbsp;</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"42585bf0-5601-44a2-b7fa-d4073fdba641">Single pla=
ce to manage features and feature assignments</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3987c1e5-3505-4442-a882-a619f95358f2">Task effic=
iency for platform integrator, product activations &amp; digital support</l=
i>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Improve feature discoverability and alig=
nment with core packaging principles</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"888154e1-b371-4a49-95b7-3b4dfea6d42b">Task effic=
iency for users to get to what they need</li>
         </ul>
         <p><br></p></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-FeatureScope">Feature Scope</h1>
    <p><strong>Must Have: </strong><span style=3D"font-size: 14.0px;letter-=
spacing: 0.0px;">Feature i</span><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">nte=
gration updates of all existing core IIS modules requiring profile alignmen=
t and high discoverability risks</span></p>
    <p><strong>Nice to Have</strong>: Feature integration updates of IIS mo=
dules with low discoverability risks</p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDIISIntegrations-KeyAssumptions">Key Assumptions</h2>
    <ul>
     <li data-uuid=3D"78f23e0f-ffb4-469b-8f5d-d05eb25812d8">Proposed change=
s will not incur significant development efforts for IIS</li>
     <li data-uuid=3D"f0d5b5a5-74f5-442b-84da-40d100a39a2b">Tools will at s=
ome point need to be converted into something else e.g. User Resources with=
 no access restrictions - to bridge the change, retain Tools as-is, ADD spe=
cific URL's within the desired nav locations for re-direct&nbsp;</li>
    </ul>
